<title>INDIA: India RBI sets 11.83 pct cut-off at 6-yr auction.</title>
<headline>India RBI sets 11.83 pct cut-off at 6-yr auction.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said it set a cut-off interest rate of 11.83 percent at its auction of six-year government paper on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>&quot;We accepted the full amount of 30 billion rupees,&quot; an RBI official told Reuters.  </p>
<p>RBI said it received 534 bids for a total of 130.45 billion rupees of which it accepted 33 bids for 30 billion rupees at a cut-off yield of 11.83 percent. Of these, 11 were partial allotments.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
